{"entries":[{"id":"tkarras-2406.02507","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯 · NVIDIA","title":"Guiding a Diffusion Model with a Bad Version of Itself","titleZh":"用自身的一个劣化版本来引导扩散模型","published":"2024-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1717459200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-2406.02507/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/06c3d7d53e34e4d2.webp","summary":"Guiding a diffusion model with a smaller, less-trained version of itself yields disentangled control over image quality without reducing variation, achieving record FID scores on ImageNet.","summaryZh":"用模型自身的一个更小、训练更少的版本来引导生成，可以在不减少多样性的情况下独立控制图像质量，在 ImageNet 上取得了创纪录的 FID 分数。"},{"id":"tkarras-2312.02696","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯","title":"Analyzing and Improving the Training Dynamics of Diffusion Models","titleZh":"分析与改进扩散模型的训练动态","published":"2023-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1701734400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-2312.02696/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/64e5e1f4db0e2866.webp","summary":"We identify and rectify uneven training dynamics in diffusion models by redesigning layers to preserve activation/weight magnitudes, achieving 1.81 FID on ImageNet-512, and propose a post-hoc EMA tuning method.","summaryZh":"我们识别并纠正了扩散模型训练中的不均匀动态，通过重新设计网络层保持激活和权重幅度，在 ImageNet-512 上实现 1.81 FID，并提出了一种事后 EMA 调优方法。"},{"id":"tkarras-2206.00364","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯","title":"Elucidating the Design Space of Diffusion-Based Generative Models","titleZh":"阐明基于扩散的生成模型的设计空间","published":"2022-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1654041600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-2206.00364/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/bc7fb6d91264fe0e.webp","summary":"We present a clear design space for diffusion-based generative models, yielding new state-of-the-art FID scores on CIFAR-10 and ImageNet-64 with faster sampling.","summaryZh":"我们提出了一个清晰的设计空间，在 CIFAR-10 和 ImageNet-64 上取得了新的最先进 FID 分数，且采样速度更快。"},{"id":"tkarras-2106.12423","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯 · NVIDIA","title":"Alias-Free Generative Adversarial Networks","titleZh":"无别名生成对抗网络","published":"2021-06-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1624406400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-2106.12423/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/2d9cfe6c9e932302.webp","summary":"We identify that aliasing in GAN generators causes unhealthy dependence on absolute pixel coordinates, and propose small architectural changes to achieve translation and rotation equivariance.","summaryZh":"我们发现生成对抗网络中的混叠现象导致了对绝对像素坐标的不健康依赖，并提出了小的架构变化以实现平移和旋转等变性。"},{"id":"tkarras-1912.04958","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯 · NVIDIA","title":"Analyzing and Improving the Image Quality of StyleGAN","titleZh":"分析并提升 StyleGAN 的图像质量","published":"2019-12-03T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1575331200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-1912.04958/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/08d17bd2d60d5091.webp","summary":"We analyze artifacts in StyleGAN and propose improvements to generator normalization, progressive growing, and regularization, achieving state-of-the-art unconditional image quality.","summaryZh":"我们分析了 StyleGAN 中的特征伪影，并提出了生成器归一化、渐进式增长和正则化方面的改进，实现了无条件图像生成的最先进质量。"},{"id":"tkarras-1812.04948","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯 · NVIDIA","title":"A Style-Based Generator Architecture for Generative Adversarial Networks","titleZh":"一种基于风格的生成对抗网络生成器架构","published":"2018-12-12T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1544572800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-1812.04948/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/da7dc9a269ace987.webp","summary":"A style-based generator architecture for GANs enables unsupervised separation of high-level attributes and stochastic variation, improving quality and disentanglement.","summaryZh":"一种基于风格的生成器架构实现了高层属性与随机变化的无监督分离，提升了生成质量和解耦能力。"},{"id":"tkarras-1710.10196","sourceId":"tkarras","sourceName":"泰罗·卡拉斯 · NVIDIA","title":"Progressive Growing of GANs for Improved Quality, Stability, and Variation","titleZh":"渐进式增长生成对抗网络：提升质量、稳定性和多样性","published":"2017-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1509062400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/tkarras-1710.10196/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/3d58c9b5cf5c12c0.webp","summary":"Progressive growing of GANs enables high-resolution image synthesis with improved quality, stability, and variation.","summaryZh":"渐进式增长生成对抗网络能够生成高质量、高分辨率图像，同时提升训练稳定性和图像多样性。"}]}